cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "OntoHajj: Ontology-Guided Neuro-Symbolic Decision Support Framework, Hajj Navigation Ontology and HajjNavQA Benchmark"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of OntoHajj, an ontology-guided neuro-symbolic decision support
  framework for mitigating large language model (LLM) hallucinations in Hajj navigation.
  The package contains the Hajj Navigation Ontology (HNO, OWL 2) with SHACL shapes for
  safety constraints C1-C8, the prototype knowledge graph for season 1447H, the bilingual
  Arabic-English HajjNavQA benchmark (736 questions), the source code of layers L2-L6
  (entity linking, ontology-guided retrieval, multi-criteria route decision, SHACL
  verification, repair and abstention), the evaluation scripts, and every answer of every
  evaluated setting for Qwen2.5-7B and gpt-oss-120b. Camp layouts, closures, dispatch slots
  and crowd observations are synthetic.
repository-code: "https://github.com/majidphd/OntoHajj"
